WEBVTT

00:00.080 --> 00:01.040
All right, my friends.

00:01.040 --> 00:05.000
So now it's clear for us that we have three layers and we have to go and build them.

00:05.000 --> 00:08.320
So that means our big epic's going to be after the layers.

00:08.320 --> 00:10.760
So here I have added three more epics.

00:10.760 --> 00:14.800
So we have build bronze layer, build silver layer and gold layer.

00:14.800 --> 00:21.240
And after that I went and start defining all the different tasks that we have to follow in the projects.

00:21.240 --> 00:26.200
So at the start we will be analyzing, then coding, and after that we're going to go and do testing.

00:26.200 --> 00:29.040
And once everything is ready, we're going to go and document stuff.

00:29.040 --> 00:32.800
And at the end we have to commit our work in the git repo.

00:32.800 --> 00:36.520
All those epics are following the same like pattern in the tasks.

00:36.520 --> 00:40.160
So as you can see now we have a very detailed project structure.

00:40.160 --> 00:44.120
And now things are more clear for us how we're going to build the data warehouse.

00:44.120 --> 00:46.720
So with that, we are done from this task.

00:46.760 --> 00:51.600
And now the next task, we have to go and define the naming convention of the projects.
